Every value this delivery introduces is an enum/string literal ("alt", "Emphasized field") or a heading-depth integer (2), never a raw color, border or spacing value; the two semantic tokens the visual distinction actually resolves to (border-accent-alt, bg-surface) were already declared in frontend/tui/frontend/src/theme.css before this delivery and are unchanged by it.
